## Customize Makefile settings for swo
##
## If you need to customize your Makefile, make
## changes here rather than in the main Makefile

# components/SWO_Software.owl is built from templates/editor/SWO_Software.tsv
# via the use_template: TRUE entry in swo-odk.yaml.  The build rule is generated
# by ODK into Makefile when `sh run.sh make update_repo` is run.
# Do NOT add a hand-written rule here to avoid duplicate-target conflicts.
